    <p>Codeyard ran its read-only analyst on its own run records: 41 runs of 19 features. Among its findings: in five runs the reviewer raised a fixed finding again, and six of seven failed runs recorded no reason for the stop. Five proposals became Issues, all merged; one of them is <a href="#memory">the reviewer case</a> above.</p>
